  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Khkt.Demo.EquipmentInfo
  title: "C\u1ED1c th\u1EE7y tinh (c\u1ED1c c\xF3 m\u1ECF)"
  description: "\u0110\u1EF1ng, pha, \u0111un n\xF3ng dung d\u1ECBch. V\u1EA1ch tr\xEAn c\u1ED1c ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1EC3 \u01B0\u1EDBc l\u01B0\u1EE3ng."
  usage: "Kh\xF4ng d\xF9ng c\u1ED1c \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111o th\u1EC3 t\xEDch ch\xEDnh x\xE1c; d\xF9ng pipet, buret ho\u1EB7c b\xECnh \u0111\u1ECBnh m\u1EE9c."
